<div class="metadata">
    <div class="info" >
        <div class="subinfo">
            <h3>
                <span class="title"><a target="_parent" href="/coa/coa/en/item/14528/index.do?q=%222014+ONCA+194%22">Baptista v. Safranko</a></span>
                        - <span class="citation">2016 ONCA 114</span>
                - <span class="publicationDate">2016-02-09</span>
            </h3>
            <div class="subMetadata">
                <span>Decisions of the Court of Appeal</span>
                    - <span>Civil</span>
            </div> 
            <div class="subject">
            </div> 
                <p class="snippet" >
                    [2] The motion judge correctly articulated the test set out in Mountain View Farms Ltd. v. McQueen, <b>2014 ONCA 194</b>, but the appellant submits that on the facts before him, the motion judge ought to have concluded that there was an air of reality to the defence. 
                </p>
                <div class="spacer">
                        <span class="decisia-icon"></span>
                        <span class="decisia-icon"></span>
                </div>
        </div> 
        <div class="documents">
