</div>
<div class="metadata">
    <div class="info" >
        <div class="subinfo">
            <h3>
                <span class="title"><a target="_parent" href="/coa/coa/en/item/24006/index.do?q=%222014+ONCA+194%22">Amex Bank of Canada v. DaCosta</a></span>
                        - <span class="citation">2026 ONCA 181</span>
                - <span class="publicationDate">2026-03-11</span>
            </h3>
            <div class="subMetadata">
                <span>Decisions of the Court of Appeal</span>
                    - <span>Civil</span>
            </div> 
            <div class="subject">
            </div> 
                <p class="snippet" >
                    [2] The motion judge recited the factors to be considered in deciding whether to aside a default judgment as approved by this court in Mountain View Farms Ltd. v. McQueen, <b>2014 ONCA 194</b>, 119 O.R. (3d) 561, at paras. 48-49. She reminded herself that the factors are not treated as rigid rules but are to be employed in the 
                </p>
