            </div> 
            <div class="subject">
            </div> 
                <p class="snippet" >
                    Those factors are set out in this court’s decision in Mountain View Farms Ltd. v. McQueen, <b>2014 ONCA 194</b>, 119 O.R. (3d) 561, at paras. 48, 49. They are: 1. whether the motion was brought promptly after the defendant learned of the default judgment; 
                </p>
