                    - <span>Civil</span>
            </div> 
            <div class="subject">
            </div> 
                <p class="snippet" >
                    [53] The appellants submit that, on the Third Motion, the Motion Judge failed to apply the legal test for setting aside default judgment set out in Mountain View Farms Ltd. v. McQueen, <b>2014 ONCA 194</b>, 119 O.R. (3d) 561, and, instead, treated the Third Motion as an appeal. 
                </p>
